295
00:16:29,480 --> 00:16:30,310
You shall not!

296
00:16:30,400 --> 00:16:32,900
I shall too! You shall not! I shall shall!

297
00:16:33,560 --> 00:16:34,720
Uh, I mean...

298
00:16:36,780 --> 00:16:38,900
